{"id":"df38af7e4180f1bc","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-bialgebra.md","title":"Bialgebra","display":"df-bialgebra — Bialgebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-bialgebra","aliases":["58-df-bialgebra","Bialgebra"],"display":"df-bialgebra — Bialgebra","depends_on":["[[58-df-algebra]]","[[58-df-coalgebra]]","[[58-df-field]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-linear-map]]","[[58-df-tensor]]","[[../batch04/58-df-algebraic-tensor-space-data.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-bialgebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-bialgebra</span><span>Bialgebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bialgebra — Bialgebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"573b416d39297a97\" href=\"?note=573b416d39297a97\" title=\"58-df-algebra\">58-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"004e048b3416923c\" href=\"?note=004e048b3416923c\" title=\"58-df-coalgebra\">58-df-coalgebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"58-df-field\">58-df-field</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f67456d74b418241\" href=\"?note=f67456d74b418241\" title=\"58-df-linear-map\">58-df-linear-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9bf75150bce95ccc\" href=\"?note=9bf75150bce95ccc\" title=\"58-df-tensor\">58-df-tensor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"df67b9abe6db5f2c\" href=\"?note=df67b9abe6db5f2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-algebraic-tensor-space-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-algebraic-tensor-space-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,k,m,\\eta,\\Delta,\\epsilon\\in V\">\\(H,k,m,\\eta,\\Delta,\\epsilon\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bialgebra}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Bialgebra}_S\\)</span> 保留六元接口。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:H\\times H\\to H\">\\(m:H\\times H\\to H\\)</span> 是原 Assertion 所使用的双线性二元乘法；对应的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\otimes_kH\\to H\">\\(H\\otimes_kH\\to H\\)</span> 线性映射由张量普遍性质确定，不将二者混为同一函数图。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K=\\langle k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal K=\\langle k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_H,\\odot_H,+_Q,\\odot_Q,Q,\\iota,m_2\">\\(+_H,\\odot_H,+_Q,\\odot_Q,Q,\\iota,m_2\\)</span> 是下式中共同量化的结构见证。二元运算以有序对为自变量。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对有限记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{r-1}\\rangle\">\\(\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{r-1}\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pr}_i\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{r-1}\\rangle=a_i\">\\(\\operatorname{pr}_i\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{r-1}\\rangle=a_i\\)</span>。带结构记录的显式谓词中，运算及零元记号均缩写当前记录的对应分量；记录格式不满足时该谓词为假。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CoalgebraLawsData}\">\\(\\mathrm{CoalgebraLawsData}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"004e048b3416923c\" href=\"?note=004e048b3416923c\" title=\"58-df-coalgebra\">58-df-coalgebra</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinearData}\">\\(\\mathrm{LinearData}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"df67b9abe6db5f2c\" href=\"?note=df67b9abe6db5f2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-algebraic-tensor-space-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-algebraic-tensor-space-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"58-df-field\">58-df-field</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}\">\\(\\mathrm{VectorSpace}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AssociativeAlgebraData}\">\\(\\mathrm{AssociativeAlgebraData}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AssociativeAlgebraData}_{58}(A,m,+_A,\\odot_A,\\mathcal K)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal K=\\langle k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(A,k,+_A,\\odot_A,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\n\\land m\\in A^{A\\times A}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in A\\;\\forall a\\in k\\;\\bigl(m(m(x,y),z)=m(x,m(y,z))\n\\land m(x+_Ay,z)=m(x,z)+_Am(y,z)\\\\\n&amp;\\land m(x,y+_Az)=m(x,y)+_Am(x,z)\n\\land m(\\odot_A(a,x),y)=\\odot_A(a,m(x,y))\n\\land m(x,\\odot_A(a,y))=\\odot_A(a,m(x,y))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AssociativeAlgebraData}_{58}(A,m,+_A,\\odot_A,\\mathcal K)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal K=\\langle k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(A,k,+_A,\\odot_A,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\n\\land m\\in A^{A\\times A}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in A\\;\\forall a\\in k\\;\\bigl(m(m(x,y),z)=m(x,m(y,z))\n\\land m(x+_Ay,z)=m(x,z)+_Am(y,z)\\\\\n&amp;\\land m(x,y+_Az)=m(x,y)+_Am(x,z)\n\\land m(\\odot_A(a,x),y)=\\odot_A(a,m(x,y))\n\\land m(x,\\odot_A(a,y))=\\odot_A(a,m(x,y))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Bialgebra}_S(H,m,\\eta,\\Delta,\\epsilon,k)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\mathcal K,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,+_H,\\odot_H,+_Q,\\odot_Q,Q,\\iota,m_2\\;\\bigl[\n\\mathcal K=\\langle k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{AssociativeAlgebraData}_{58}(H,m,+_H,\\odot_H,\\mathcal K)\n\\land\\mathrm{CoalgebraLawsData}_{58}(H,\\Delta,\\epsilon,Q,\\iota,+_H,\\odot_H,+_Q,\\odot_Q,\\mathcal K)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{LinearData}_{58}(\\eta,k,H,k,+_k,\\cdot_k,+_H,\\odot_H)\n\\land\\mathrm{AssociativeAlgebraData}_{58}(Q,m_2,+_Q,\\odot_Q,\\mathcal K)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x_0,x_1,y_0,y_1\\in H\\;\nm_2(\\iota(x_0,x_1),\\iota(y_0,y_1))=\\iota(m(x_0,y_0),m(x_1,y_1))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in H\\;\\bigl(m(\\eta(1_k),x)=x\\land m(x,\\eta(1_k))=x\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in H\\;\\bigl(\\Delta(m(x,y))=m_2(\\Delta(x),\\Delta(y))\n\\land\\epsilon(m(x,y))=\\epsilon(x)\\cdot_k\\epsilon(y)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Delta(\\eta(1_k))=\\iota(\\eta(1_k),\\eta(1_k))\\land\\epsilon(\\eta(1_k))=1_k\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Bialgebra}_S(H,m,\\eta,\\Delta,\\epsilon,k)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\mathcal K,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,+_H,\\odot_H,+_Q,\\odot_Q,Q,\\iota,m_2\\;\\bigl[\n\\mathcal K=\\langle k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{AssociativeAlgebraData}_{58}(H,m,+_H,\\odot_H,\\mathcal K)\n\\land\\mathrm{CoalgebraLawsData}_{58}(H,\\Delta,\\epsilon,Q,\\iota,+_H,\\odot_H,+_Q,\\odot_Q,\\mathcal K)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{LinearData}_{58}(\\eta,k,H,k,+_k,\\cdot_k,+_H,\\odot_H)\n\\land\\mathrm{AssociativeAlgebraData}_{58}(Q,m_2,+_Q,\\odot_Q,\\mathcal K)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x_0,x_1,y_0,y_1\\in H\\;\nm_2(\\iota(x_0,x_1),\\iota(y_0,y_1))=\\iota(m(x_0,y_0),m(x_1,y_1))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in H\\;\\bigl(m(\\eta(1_k),x)=x\\land m(x,\\eta(1_k))=x\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in H\\;\\bigl(\\Delta(m(x,y))=m_2(\\Delta(x),\\Delta(y))\n\\land\\epsilon(m(x,y))=\\epsilon(x)\\cdot_k\\epsilon(y)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Delta(\\eta(1_k))=\\iota(\\eta(1_k),\\eta(1_k))\\land\\epsilon(\\eta(1_k))=1_k\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留二元乘法的原 Assertion 接口，校正 Hypothesis 中将其误写为张量积上线性函数的矛盾。代数、余代数和张量乘法共用同一组域及向量空间运算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Sweedler, Hopf Algebras</li>\n<li>Chari and Pressley, A Guide to Quantum Groups</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"573b416d39297a97","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-coalgebra","status":"resolved","id":"004e048b3416923c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-coalgebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-field","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-field]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-linear-map","status":"resolved","id":"f67456d74b418241","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-linear-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-tensor","status":"resolved","id":"9bf75150bce95ccc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-tensor]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-algebraic-tensor-space-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"df67b9abe6db5f2c","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-algebraic-tensor-space-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-coalgebra","status":"resolved","id":"004e048b3416923c","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{CoalgebraLawsData}$ 取 [[58-df-coalgebra]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-algebraic-tensor-space-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"df67b9abe6db5f2c","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{LinearData}$ 取 [[../batch04/58-df-algebraic-tensor-space-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-field","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Field}$ 取 [[58-df-field]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{VectorSpace}$ 取 [[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"H,k,m,\\eta,\\Delta,\\epsilon\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bialgebra}_S","display":false},{"tex":"m:H\\times H\\to H","display":false},{"tex":"H\\otimes_kH\\to H","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K=\\langle k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"+_H,\\odot_H,+_Q,\\odot_Q,Q,\\iota,m_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{r-1}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pr}_i\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{r-1}\\rangle=a_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CoalgebraLawsData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LinearData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Field}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AssociativeAlgebraData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AssociativeAlgebraData}_{58}(A,m,+_A,\\odot_A,\\mathcal K)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathcal K=\\langle k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(A,k,+_A,\\odot_A,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\n\\land m\\in A^{A\\times A}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in A\\;\\forall a\\in k\\;\\bigl(m(m(x,y),z)=m(x,m(y,z))\n\\land m(x+_Ay,z)=m(x,z)+_Am(y,z)\\\\\n&\\land m(x,y+_Az)=m(x,y)+_Am(x,z)\n\\land m(\\odot_A(a,x),y)=\\odot_A(a,m(x,y))\n\\land m(x,\\odot_A(a,y))=\\odot_A(a,m(x,y))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Bialgebra}_S(H,m,\\eta,\\Delta,\\epsilon,k)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists\\mathcal K,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,+_H,\\odot_H,+_Q,\\odot_Q,Q,\\iota,m_2\\;\\bigl[\n\\mathcal K=\\langle k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{AssociativeAlgebraData}_{58}(H,m,+_H,\\odot_H,\\mathcal K)\n\\land\\mathrm{CoalgebraLawsData}_{58}(H,\\Delta,\\epsilon,Q,\\iota,+_H,\\odot_H,+_Q,\\odot_Q,\\mathcal K)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{LinearData}_{58}(\\eta,k,H,k,+_k,\\cdot_k,+_H,\\odot_H)\n\\land\\mathrm{AssociativeAlgebraData}_{58}(Q,m_2,+_Q,\\odot_Q,\\mathcal K)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x_0,x_1,y_0,y_1\\in H\\;\nm_2(\\iota(x_0,x_1),\\iota(y_0,y_1))=\\iota(m(x_0,y_0),m(x_1,y_1))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in H\\;\\bigl(m(\\eta(1_k),x)=x\\land m(x,\\eta(1_k))=x\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y\\in H\\;\\bigl(\\Delta(m(x,y))=m_2(\\Delta(x),\\Delta(y))\n\\land\\epsilon(m(x,y))=\\epsilon(x)\\cdot_k\\epsilon(y)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\Delta(\\eta(1_k))=\\iota(\\eta(1_k),\\eta(1_k))\\land\\epsilon(\\eta(1_k))=1_k\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3593,"backlinks":[{"id":"b0f7663908a1058a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-180","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-bialgebra.md|58-df-bialgebra]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["573b416d39297a97","004e048b3416923c","1eb4a89b005d9cda","36d7463d215be751","f67456d74b418241","9bf75150bce95ccc","df67b9abe6db5f2c","592f9cfb66a507c2"]}